  ((select id from w), 'sequence', 'Given these four half-lines from two proverbs, pair each first half with its correct second half and place the two completed proverbs in the order they occur in the book.',
   'Proverbs 15:1; 16:18', 'A gentle answer turns away wrath, but a harsh word stirs up anger.; Pride goes before destruction, and an arrogant spirit before a fall.', 'WEB', 5, 'hard',
